{"id": "34437", "title": "冒牌淑女A计划", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 52, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34437.htm", "intro": "吓！人果然不能太有好奇心，要不是他一时情不自禁看了她的日记本，他还真不知道她竟然……一直在暗恋他！当场让他像被雷打中般的不知所措，不过……好吧！他得承认，自从知道“真相”后，他对她的感觉是有那么一点点不一样了，他开始忍不住的去关心她、宠她……呃，念她，可是，这女人还真不是普通的迟钝耶！他都已经当著大家的面，说要让她升格当他的女朋友说，她却还是一味的只想赶他走，让他的前女友夹去配，吼～～气死他了啦！看来他只好用其他的步数，让她乖乖踏进他所设的爱的陷阱里……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34437", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2185896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2185897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "21